# BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore when building with -f backend/Dockerfile from
# the repository root. Keep the build context small and free of secrets.
.git
**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
frontend
data
reports
scripts
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/build
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
backend/tests
